<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's BR Distribuidora 8-mo net falls.</title>
<headline>Brazil's BR Distribuidora 8-mo net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned fuel distributor BR Petrobras Distribuidora SA released the following figures for 1996's first eight months.</p>
<p>		   Jan-Aug 1996	Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p>    Net Profit    $86 million	     $152.1 million</p>
<p>    Gross Sales   $5.695 bln	  $5.437 bln</p>
<p>    Net Worth     $1.134 bln	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>The firm also said in a statement that profitability over net worth was 8.2 percent in the period versus 17.2 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 232 4411</p>
</text>
